DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260428T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260428T200000
SUMMARY:Splat Space Board meeting
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nOn the last Tuesday of eac
 h month we hold our board meeting. This meeting is a chance for Splat Spac
 e's board to meet and discuss what will be on the meeting agenda for the M
 ember Meeting\, which is held on the 1st Tuesday of each month.\n\nThis me
 eting is usually held in person at Splat Space.\n\nGoogle Meet Video Call:
 \n[https://meet.google.com/usc-eavv-jkc](https://meet.google.com/usc-eavv-
 jkc)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/314188390/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260408T231819Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T231819Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_314203935@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260427T035430Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260429T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260429T200000
SUMMARY:Woodshop Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nWhat is Wood-shop Wednesda
 y? Well its basically an open house for the Splat Space Wood-shop.\n\nHave
  a project you need help with? Want to learn how to safely use the wood sh
 op equipment? Just want to hang out and talk shop? Come on by. Each week o
 ne or more of our more knowledgeable wood workers will be there to help. N
 o need to sign up.\n\nNot a Splat Space member?\nWell you are also welcome
  to join us\, but unfortunately because of insurance limitation\, you cann
 ot use the equipment.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you all there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/314203935/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260409T212556Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260409T212556Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_314248460@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260427T035430Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T160000
SUMMARY:Open House
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nEvery Saturday between 1pm
  to 4pm we open our doors to the public to give anyone who wants to stop b
 y a chance to see our space. It's a chance for prospective new members to 
 take a tour of our space and ask any questions they have about what we off
 er.\n\nFeel free to come by or contact us if you want to schedule a tour.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/314248460/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260412T172314Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T172314Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
